{"id":"NCT06953869","title":"Evaluating the Effects of Tasimelteon vs. Placebo in Treating Pediatric Insomnia","official":"A Multicenter, Double-Blind, Randomized Study to Evaluate the Effects of Tasimelteon vs. Placebo in Treating Pediatric Insomnia","summary":"This is a multicenter, double-blind, randomized study to evaluate the efficacy and safety of a daily single oral dose of tasimelteon and matching placebo in male and female pediatric participants with insomnia disorder.","conditions":["Insomnia Disorder"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Tasimelteon Oral Suspension"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Ability and acceptance to provide written informed consent of the participant or legal guardian (and assent as required).\n* Confirmed clinical diagnosis of insomnia disorder\n* Males and Females between 2 and 17 years, inclusive.\n* The sleep disturbance must not be a result of another medication.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Inability to dose daily with tasimelteon or previous intolerance to tasimelteon.\n* Indication of impaired liver function.\n* Pregnant or lactating females.\n* A positive test for drugs of abuse.","minAge":"2 Years","maxAge":"17 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":420,"start":"2025-04-21","pcd":"2027-11","upd":"2026-06-05","sponsor":"Vanda Pharmaceuticals","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Vanda Pharmaceuticals, Inc. · 202-734-3400 · VEC162@vandapharma.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Vanda Investigational Site","city":"Dothan","pr":"Alabama","zip":"36303","s":"R","lat":31.2232,"lon":-85.3905,"c":"Vanda Pharmaceuticals"},{"f":"Vanda Investigational Site","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85006","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Vanda Pharmaceuticals"},{"f":"Vanda Investigational Site","city":"Irvine","pr":"California","zip":"92614","s":"R","lat":33.6695,"lon":-117.8231,"c":"Vanda Pharmaceuticals"},{"f":"Vanda Investigational Site","ci